#: ../../../policy/CMP0226.rst:2
msgid "CMP0226"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../policy/CMP0226.rst:6
msgid ""
"Apply Swift module name to targets when using the :generator:`Xcode` "
"generator."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../policy/CMP0226.rst:8
msgid ""
"This policy ensures that the module name specified in :prop_tgt:"
"`Swift_MODULE_NAME` is applied to the target when using the :generator:"
"`Xcode` generator."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../policy/CMP0226.rst:12
msgid ""
"The ``OLD`` behavior for this policy builds the Swift target with the target "
"name as the module name. Setting :prop_tgt:`Swift_MODULE_NAME` has no effect "
"on the compilation of targets."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../policy/CMP0226.rst:16
msgid ""
"The ``NEW`` behavior applies custom Swift module names specified with the :"
"prop_tgt:`Swift_MODULE_NAME` target property, if one is specified."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../policy/include/STANDARD_ADVICE.rst:1
msgid ""
"This policy was introduced in CMake version |INTRODUCED_IN_CMAKE_VERSION|. "
"It may be set by :command:`cmake_policy` or :command:"
"`cmake_minimum_required`. If it is not set, CMake |WARNS_OR_DOES_NOT_WARN|, "
"and uses ``OLD`` behavior."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../policy/include/DEPRECATED.rst:2
msgid ""
"The ``OLD`` behavior of a policy is :ref:`deprecated by definition <cmake-"
"policies-intro>` and may be removed in a future version of CMake."
msgstr ""
